OL,3,CBoy, 13, arrested after car theft as
OL,4,Cdrivers urged to lock vehicles
OL,6,FDrivers are being urged to lock their
OL,7,Fvehicles and hide valuables after a 13-
OL,8,Fyear-old boy was arrested following a
OL,9,Fspate of reported crimes involving
OL,10,Fcars.
OL,12,FBetween 7pm on Saturday 1 August and
OL,13,F3am on Sunday 2 August, the States of
OL,14,FJersey Police say that a grey Nissan
OL,15,FLeaf was taken from Don Farm on La
OL,16,FRoute Des Quennevais in St Brelade and
OL,17,F"damage was caused".
