OL,3,CBoy, 13, arrested after car theft as
OL,4,Cdrivers urged to lock vehicles
OL,6,FThen, at around 5:30am, two young men
OL,7,Fwere reportedly seen trying the
OL,8,Fhandles of vehicles in the area of the
OL,9,FLes Quennevais Precinct.
OL,11,FThis includes an alleged attempt to
OL,12,Fsteal a grey Fiat 500 Lounge car which
OL,13,Fhad been left unlocked and reports of
OL,14,Fitems being taken from within vehicles.
OL,16,FThe 13-year-old boy who was arrested
OL,17,Fat around 1:30am on Monday (3 August)
OL,18,Fhas been released on bail.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
