OL,3,CBoy, 13, arrested after car theft as
OL,4,Cdrivers urged to lock vehicles
OL,6,FA police spokesperson says: "Jersey is
OL,7,Fa safe place to live, but simple
OL,8,Fprecautions still matter.
OL,10,F"Locking your vehicle and removing
OL,11,Fyour keys helps reduce opportunities
OL,12,Ffor crime and can prevent incidents
OL,13,Fescalating into something far more
OL,14,Fserious. Please work with us to keep
OL,15,Four community safe."
OL,17,FA car key (pictured above) has been
OL,18,Frecovered during the police
OL,19,Finvestigation, with the force asking
OL,20,Fanyone who recognises it or has other
OL,21,Fdetails to come forward.
